# draw1 (decision 0203): the F8 plug-in list on the engine in node (virtual time): the first idle, Enter closes the wizard (as cmp-short.g3), a main-window snapshot, F8 (0x77), snapshots of the opening
# animation every 250 virtual ms for 4 s, Escape, snapshots of the closing.
snap wiz0
advance 4000
tap 13
advance 3000
snap e3000
advance 2000
snap main-idle
tap 0x77
advance 100
snap f8-0100
advance 150
snap f8-0250
advance 250
snap f8-0500
advance 250
snap f8-0750
advance 250
snap f8-1000
advance 500
snap f8-1500
advance 500
snap f8-2000
advance 1000
snap f8-3000
advance 1000
snap f8-4000
tap 27
advance 100
snap c-0100
advance 400
snap c-0500
advance 1000
snap c-1500
advance 2000
snap c-3500
end
